Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Ninth Episode\NThe Stolen Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- They say the Queen is sick.\N- And seriously so, it seems!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there no cures\Nfor this illness?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir, but it\Nseems there are none.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Something she ate\Nmust have made her sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.\NAnyway, food poisoning...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...is a very dangerous thing.\N- I heard she has a high fever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.14,0:02:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Many doctors have examined her,\Nbut no one has managed to cure her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel very sorry for\Nher She is still so young!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I hear!\NThe Queen... is sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.54,0:02:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there are any\Nmedicines to cure her...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I must help Sapphire's mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I must rush to the Palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Halt!\N- Let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:03:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the Palace as if\Nit were my own home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the shortest way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is about to pass away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- What was that?\N- Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you? Why don't\Nyou watch where you are going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I beg you, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I am sure that\Nyour mother can be saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I will ask the Lady of the Heavens\Nto grant this favor for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady of the Heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire's mother is sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:04:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Help her, please! Save her!\NI know you can do it, if you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Lily!\NTink, I haven't seen you for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,what have you called me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Lily! The Queen is dying\Nfrom a malignant fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the magic flower,\Nonly with it can she be cured!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand! Which of you is the one\Nwho loves the Queen the most,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- climb onto my back.\N- I will come! I am her daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb onto your back?\NBut how do I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a flying horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am a flying horse.\NYou're surprised, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Lily\Nand I am in the service of Venus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it is she who has power\Nover love and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Power over love and life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, though,\Nbecause Venus is very vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She cares a lot about her beauty and\Ndoesn't want anyone more beautiful than her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We will arrive at her\Ndwelling soon, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! That is her Temple!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful! I have never\Nsmelled such an intense fragrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the flowers of love for friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and all living\Ncreatures are her friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Those others, on the other hand,\Nare the flowers of love for enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those over there are the flowers\Nof a mother's love for her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- And those are...\N- That's enough, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Sapphire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I am here to ask you for\Na magic flower for my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. And I also know that you aren't\Na Prince, but a Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Lily, bring me the flower\Nof rebirth immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a beautiful girl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that you are indeed very pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the flower of rebirth\Nand it will heal your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you\Nfor your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want it, don't you?\N- Yes, I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to do anything to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even giving your beauty\Nin exchange for the flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Don't you think you're asking too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You shut up, Lily! Sapphire, what\Nwould you say if I made you ugly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:07:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...in exchange for this flower?\N- Make me ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you decide?\NYes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take my beauty!\NI don't care about becoming ugly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- if I can have that flower.\N- Ah, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So you prefer to become ugly?\NThen get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me all your beauty,\NPrincess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go home!\NFarewell, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the flower, but\Nyou will be ugly forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, she is coming to! She is\Nalready less pale than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, your mother's\Nfever has broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, come near me,\Nmy dear daughter, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sapphire,\Nwhy are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared me\Nwith that mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have a mask, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a spy in the castle!\NArrest her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why has Venus treated me\Nso cruelly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,even though she has power\Nover love and life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Surrender! You are surrounded!\N- Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? I am Princess\NSapphire, don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are really Prince Sapphire,\Nshow us, take off your mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.02,0:08:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- But I...\N- If you don't do it, it means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you are certainly a spy\Nfrom another country!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not true! Believe me, I am\Ntruly Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not true, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!\NFire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He escaped! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quick, this way!\N- Let's search for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- He escaped that way!\N- There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's run!\N- Quick, chase him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Surrender, you scoundrel!\N- I am Sapphire, believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So much the worse for you!\NLet's kill her! Filthy spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!\NI am Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Stop it!\NIt really is Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal! Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Away, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried! I wonder where my\Ndear Sapphire could have gone...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor child!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh! Go ahead and laugh, if you're\Nsatisfied with what you've done to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Help!\N- Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- I'll give you a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where am I?\N- I'm glad you've recovered!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you the one who helped me?\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you from the bottom\Nof my heart. Where am I now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.98,0:12:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're in a village church.\N- Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.90,0:12:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Riccardo and I am\Nthe Prince of the Land of Troubles!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- And what about you, what is your name?\N- Call me Pierre!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tell me, what happened to you?\N- Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be walking,\Nit's still too early!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're wearing a mask!\NWhy are you wearing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You must certainly have a good reason.\NYou can take it off! Tell me what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me questions, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life\Nand I am very grateful to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to come to my Kingdom\Nand be a guest in my castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, where could you be now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you would come home and not\Nleave me so worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the cold air\Nis not good for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- you are still convalescing!\N- That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter\Nwill surely return home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll return!\NBut I would so love to have wings...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...like a bird,\Nso I could fly to find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My castle is down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The people at the castle might\Nbe frightened to see me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t care\Nabout what people might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my guest! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to your right.\NThere is the Land of Troubles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who goes there?\N- I am Prince Richard, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If I heard correctly, Richard\Nhas returned! Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Richard, where have you been\Nall this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Donald! I’ve been out for\Na long walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that guy\Nyou’ve got with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s a friend of mine and he’ll be staying\Nat the castle. His name is Pierre!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's wearing a mask!\NTell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,do you want to take off that mask?\NWhat are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know\Nthat it's not good manners..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...to keep a mask on\Nwhen introducing yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?! Either you're an arrogant type..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...or no one taught you\Nthe rules of good manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone, Donald! He's a good\Nguy and he saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you think! There's a\Nreason why he wears a mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Jan?\NHe has a specific reason, she says!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you come here for,\Nyou shady suspicious character?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, both of you, stop it! He's\Nnot a suspicious character at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now let us pass, Jan!\N- Jan strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- If Jan doesn't want to, no one passes!\N- You'd better tell him to get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I want to take off your mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it, Donald, don't touch him!\N- Riccardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be a spy from an enemy country!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see your face! If\Nyou don't take it off, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Donald, stop it, I said!\NEnough! Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a kind boy,\Nisn't that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He is not what you think!\NDonald, leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't treat him like that,\Nhe hasn't done anything wrong to you..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...and he saved my life!\N- Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have proven\Nto be a real spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I really...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You took advantage\Nof my brother's kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...to enter the castle.\NJean, hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Jan kill too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Pierre, don't wait for him!\NThat big brute is very dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers, close the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dammit!\N- Now you can no longer escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Jan! Donald, that's enough!\NMake him stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jan kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the situation\Nthat girl has gotten herself into!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon she won't just be ugly\Nin the face,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but her body will also be full\Nof scars. Well, too bad for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I am lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in heaven,\Nlisten to me, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect Sapphire\Nwherever she has ended up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- But you're Lily!\N- Yes! Hop on my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- I found out where Sapphire is!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, it's so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's snowing, too! Lily,\Ncan you tell me where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's in the Land of Troubles!\N- Is this country far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a bit, but we'll get\Nthere soon. Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Jan kill!\NLike this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Jan, kill him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Pierre!\NDon't go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.10,0:19:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Jan wins now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! What harm have I done to you?\NLet me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will let you out\Nonly if you take off your mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.82,0:19:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off your mask\Nand show us your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't worry, I'll take it off her!\N- What a beautiful woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is Opal!\NWhat happened, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, regain your strength!\NWhere is Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quick, show me where she is!\N- This man has fainted too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon they will both\Nrecover! Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There are footprints\Ngoing to that small door!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus, why do you treat me\Nwith such cruelty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Because you are too beautiful!\N- But if I am now the ugliest..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...of all women? - No!\NYou are still too beautiful in your soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore I will also change your heart.\NIn fact, a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...with an ugly heart\Ncannot help but become ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind that your mother\Ncould become very ill again,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,if you do not obey me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mother, what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use crying.\NResign yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Venus, don't act like\Nthis! Why are you being so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't meddle in things that\Ndon't concern you, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But Sapphire is my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, the Lord is angry\Nwith you for your selfishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't told him\Neverything, I hope, right, Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't told him\Nanything, but he knows anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You brat! This will teach\Nyou to be so impertinent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.14,0:20:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not a Goddess, you\Nare a demon! A horrible demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am Venus, the\NGoddess of beauty...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...who can dispose of the love\Nand the lives of common mortals!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that is\Nbeautiful belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So I also have the right\Nto make the beautiful ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Sapphire, I want you\Nto be ugly in face and soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! The ugliest in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus! Venus!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I not tell you to watch\Nover beauty, love, and life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me, instead, that you play...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...with people's beauty\Nin a very selfish way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore you yourself shall become ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you will know how\Nthe people you have hurt feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want to become ugly!\NForgive me, Father, I won't do it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Venus has\Nbecome a little pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire has fainted!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, I don't want\Nto see anyone anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the ugliest in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're ugly! I am\Nyour friend and I will always love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.14,0:22:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you.\N- Now take off your mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't run away\Nif my face scares you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I that ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!\NYou are exactly the same as before!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- You have the same face!\N- The same face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.14,0:23:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.58,0:23:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold it against me\Nif I hid my identity from you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.42,0:23:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, Sapphire.\NI will never forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.54,0:23:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very sorry, Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that, despite everything,\Nyou will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean is very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you sure\Nthat you are really Venus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, go home without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to Heaven to ask\Nthe Lord to forgive Venus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Riccardo, Donald, Jean...\NGoodbye, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye, Sapphire! See you soon!\N- Bye! Bye!
